ndependent power configurations, Smart Aim court scoring, and synchronized serve tilt.\n\n\n\nDefensive Automation\n\nAuto Block: Automatically reads ball trajectory and net proximity. Fires native jump blocks inside authentic hitboxes. Features customizable reaction profiles (Instant, Fast, Default, Safe) and multi-mode support (Auto Set, Net Fish, Set Block).\n\nBlock Aim & Tilt: Features Antenna, Center, and Straight aim locks with mid-air stabilization and native W/A/S/D tilt integration.\n\nAuto Dive & Receive: Triggers low-ball dive saves automatically. Grounded receive methods support Auto Bumps and Ground Sets utilizing live trajectory, ping, and speed variables.\n\nAdaptive Receive Power & Aim: Dynamically adjusts Bump power (capped at 5) and Ground Set power (capped at 10) based on court depth. Targets your court, the enemy court, or specific teammates without facing jitter.\n\nReceive Magnet: Auto-walks the player directly to the ball's intercept point using native pathing. Starts tracking while the ball is mid-flight.\n\n\n\nVISUALS, UTILITIES, & PERFORMANCE\n\nMatchmaking & Teleports: Monitors court rosters to auto-join priority queue slots. Includes quick teleport nodes to Lobby areas, team pads, sidelines, and specific players.\n\nESP & Visualizer: Ball trajectory ESP (with ownership filters), Smart Aim landing spots, and custom Player/NPC highlights showing active roles (Spike, Set, Serve). Features court-boundary overlays and a 6-zone net grid.\n\nHitbox Visualizer: Instantiates client-side visual reach proxies for Block, Bump, Dive, Serve, Set, and Spike states.\n\nPerformance Cleanup: Offers selective client-side cleanup of player accessories, hit effects, decals, lights, and post-processing. Includes a 30-360 FPS limiter and quick graphic presets.\n\nAuto Shop: Event-driven merchant automation that scans active items and buys targeted rotation features without polling. Includes an Item Encyclopedia to inspect unreleased gear.\n\nWebhooks & Stats: